@startuml trust_auditability_model
skinparam shadowing false
title Trustworthiness and Auditability - model (EPIC-010-F-002)\nas of 10/4/26

package "Trust registry (persisted)" as REG #Honeydew {
  class "rules" as Rules {
    rule_id
    build_version
    definition (e.g. the LLM query)
  }
  class "facts" as TrustFacts {
    fact_ref   (which derived fact)
    score : 0.0 .. 1.0
    rule_id
    build
  }
  TrustFacts "many" --> "1" Rules : rule_id @ build
}

package "Domain fact collections (persisted)\nProviderMedicare, SpecialtyMedicare, Indication Map, ..." as DOM #AliceBlue {
  class DerivedFact
}

TrustFacts "1" --> "1" DerivedFact : governs (fact_ref)

note bottom of REG : the registry is the whole home of trust:\nrules + one trust record per governed fact.\naudit = a read of the registry (facts x rules);\ntraceability is implicit: fact -> trust fact -> rule -> build
@enduml
